      "text": "Jane Doe is a computational biologist who develops synthetic methods and standards for analyzing example region data. Her group builds infrastructure for reproducible analysis including a sample metadata standard, a reference asset manager, and analysis pipelines, with recent emphasis on vector representations of example regions."
